# The dump starts about 1 s after the game's first write, not 2 s: a player who
# saves and presses MODE a second or two later (which restarts the console with
# no chance to flush) keeps the save. (The fake core's blocks cost far more sim
# time than the wire's; the RTL suites time the whole save.)
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "game.sms"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-core smstang
poke-save 0x10 0x42
wait-dump 1500ms
expect-file saves/sms/game.sav size 32768
